oman and also that the girl in front of  them is too young since vegapunk has  been active so long and this could have  been explained in a variety of ways like  the whole having a cyborg body thing but  as many of you noticed last time there  was a punk too on this Punk shirt and  that does come into play here in reality  Punk 2 explains this isn't the main  Stella body but Punk 2 Vega Punk Lilith  more on this whole aspect of vegapunk  later on in the chapter for now punk 2  tells them that since they run through  their research funds in a jiffy she'll  allow them to skedaddle if they just  relinquish their valuables I love  vegapunk's personality here everything  for money so that it could work more on  Research completely obsessed just as a  mad scientist should be Nami is  hilarious when she says what kind of  rescue do you call this only for Punk 2  to again reiterate this is not a rescue  weaponized sea beasts or summon but the  funny thing is they all seem to be based  on non-sea animals like giraffes and  lions but with scales Frankie for his  part is still excited to see the Seabees  while usop is already starting to get  worried here Zorro though is cool stoic  and calm as always then Punk 2 gets a  message not to underestimate them it's  pointed out that that's pirate Hunter  Zorro who has a 1.11 billion Bounty it's  also pointed out how comsoro is and how  Zorro knows punctu is in his range and  he can end them in an instant the same  goes for Robin CBS or not they know how  to prioritize the most essential targets  first because of the so-called imbeciles  that odd over Punk 2 and the inventions  she was lulled into a false sense of  secure dirty I like how everyone played  a role here in getting the upper hand  against Punk 2 even if they didn't know  what they were doing then Zoro finally  speaks to vegapunk and when Zoro speaks  we all listen he says there's something  I want from you so you'd better play  nice got it end quote so cool man so  cool 