 a winter Island but with the  magic of science they can set it to  Tropical mode imagine if instead of  snowbirding to a warm country over the  winter you could just set your country  to Tropical pretty cool technology I  must say Chopper notes that punk six is  as big as kaido and when Luffy punches  it to see if it's a hologram it  backfires Punk six punches him back and  sends him flying he hits into the  machine with the pictures of food on it  and it produces Burgers and Fries here  we pretty much see stuff available in  Tokyo today but even more extreme  versions of it Luffy Bonnie and Chopper  pig out and I really like Luffy and  Bonnie's shared love of food I must say  this dynamic between the two of them is  really growing on me we're told the  unmanned cooking device can turn raw  ingredients into one of 500 unique  dishes in under a minute it's added that  the make do with what you've got mode is  the best and I love that Oda added that  last mode because I was wondering what  happens if some ingredients run out  before others and you can't really get  what you wanted of course if you're rich  enough you you can probably have it  refilled every day Punk 6 points out  that they can't be too happy since the  lack of competent Engineers means that  it can't be mass produced and wonders if  following the blueprints are really that  hard the lack of funds and resources  clearly upsets Punk six who hits the  dragon-looking creature and if you're  wondering how she was able to punch the  Hologram it's because her photonic  gloves make it possible to physically  interact with light this is a very  interesting idea too and something that  we'll definitely see down the line in  our world we already see it a bit in how  we can interact with augmented reality  through our phones Luffy asks if the  Hologram girl he's looking at isn't real  while Punk six throws in some philosophy  saying debates on what makes something  real are as old as time it's something  you'll 